commit 72fd40b7b144266fc1f75d139426523c8d807fa9
Author: Realmagnum <realmagnum@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 15 03:02:58 2026 +0300

    feat(web): drag-drop organizational records between collections
    
    Add drag-and-drop support for moving vault items between collections in
    the self-hosted Bitwarden Web Vault client.
    
    - vault-cipher-row.component.ts: draggable=true, dragstart/dragend handlers
    - vault-filter-section.component.ts/html: drop-zone for collection tree
    - webpack.base.js: reduce source-map memory pressure during build
    
    Refs: feature/drag-drop branch on Realmagnum/bw_web_builds

